.TH RUSTED-EXCEL 1 "2026-11-27" "rusted-excel 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rusted-excel \- a lightweight desktop spreadsheet
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rusted-excel
.RB [ \-h | \-\-help ]
.RB [ \-v | \-\-version ]
.RI [ FILE.csv ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Rusted Excel
is a small desktop spreadsheet application. Its user interface is written in
Rust and its cell storage, CSV parsing and formula evaluation are implemented
in a native C/C++ core. It starts with an empty document when no file is given.
.PP
The application provides a menu bar, toolbar, name box, formula bar, a
scrollable cell grid, sheet tabs and a status bar. It supports multiple sheets,
basic cell formatting, undo/redo, and formulas such as
.BR =SUM(A1:A10) ,
.BR =AVG(B1:B5) ,
and
.BR =IF(A1>0,1,0) .
Only one document can be opened at a time; documents are read from and written
to comma-separated values (CSV) files.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print a short usage message to standard output and exit successfully.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print the application name and version to standard output and exit successfully.
.TP
.I FILE.csv
Open the given CSV file on startup. A quoted-field CSV dialect is accepted.
Only one file argument may be supplied. If the file is malformed, too large, or
cannot be read, an error dialog is shown and an empty document is used instead.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/bin/rusted-excel
The application executable.
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/rusted-excel.desktop
Desktop entry used by application launchers.
.TP
.I /usr/share/metainfo/rusted-excel.metainfo.xml
AppStream metadata describing the application.
.TP
.I /usr/share/pixmaps/rusted-excel.png
Legacy menu icon.
.TP
.I /usr/share/icons/hicolor/*/apps/rusted-excel.png
Scalable installation of the application icon in hicolor sizes.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Successful startup request, or a help/version request completed.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid command line, such as an unknown option or more than one file argument.
.PP
Normal termination of the graphical application also returns 0.
.SH SEE ALSO
The project homepage:
.UR https://github.com/hasaanamerravid-source/Rusted-Excel
.UE
